"charge du condensateur ; l’angle des cordes suit Vc (35° pour 1 V), la "
"hauteur suit l’énergie ½ C Vc²"
msgstr ""
"charge of the capacitor; the rope angle follows Vc (35° for 1 V), the height "
"follows the energy ½ C Vc²"

